OL,3,GNEWSATraffic at standstill on M25 after
OL,4,Avehicle fire
OL,5,
OL,6,FTraffic is at a standstill on a section
OL,7,Fof the M25 in Surrey after a vehicle
OL,8,Ffire, according to National Highways.
OL,10,FThe fire has been put out, but
OL,11,Fanticlockwise traffic between junction
OL,12,Fnine for Leatherhead and junction eight
OL,13,Ffor Reigate remains affected by the
OL,14,Fdisruption.
OL,16,FNational Highways said at 09:00 GMT
OL,17,Fthat there were current delays of about
OL,18,F50 minutes on the approach to the
OL,19,Fincident.
OL,21,FVehicle recovery and clear up works
OL,22,Fwere under way, it added.
